# Messaging

Full write-up: `docs/MESSAGING.md`.

## Piece context in the thread

When a visitor inquires about a piece, prepend `@Piece Title` into the **message body**
via `withPieceTag` so history stays clear for visitor and Mark. Render with
`ChatBubbleBody`. Do not hide the piece name only on the thread row.

## Email

Requires `RESEND_API_KEY` + `MARK_NOTIFY_EMAIL`. Unread live messages wait ~2 minutes
before email (cancelled if Mark opens the thread). Cron: `/api/cron/chat-reminders`.

## Auth boundary

Visitor chat uses site passcodes + cookies, **not** Supabase Auth. Never put visitors
into `auth.users` for chat — that would risk `/admin` access.
